title: ITC_Start
tags: itc mainline base
---
<<itc_bg main_menu>>
<<itc_pc_avatar_hide>>
<<itc_npc_main_hide>>
<<itc_npc_avatar_hide>>
<<declare $DAY = 1>>
<<declare $Sign_mistake = 0>>
<<declare $satisfaction = 3>>
<<declare $money = 0>>
<<declare $Nmber_of_sign_mistake = 0>>
<<declare $First_contract_sign_success = 0>>
<<declare $Global_sign_mistake = 0>>
<<declare $Kindness_Level = 0>>
<<declare $Evil_Level = 0>>
<<declare $Hell_camp = 0>>
<<declare $Heaven_camp = 0>>
<<declare $Neutral_camp = 0>>
<<declare $Business_camp = 0>>
<<declare $Gang_camp = 0>>
<<declare $Sys_CurrentDay = 1>>
<<declare $Sys_IsGameFinished = false>>
<<declare $Sys_CurrentPhase = "Prologue">>
<<declare $Route_CurrentClient = 0>>
<<declare $Route_DocReviewResult = "passed">>
<<declare $Route_RuneVerifyResult = "skipped">>
<<declare $Route_RuneVerifyDebuff = 0>>
<<declare $Route_StampType = "">>
<<declare $Route_QTEErrorCount = 0>>
<<declare $Route_SoulCollectPercent = 0>>
<<declare $Route_SoulMin = 0>>
<<declare $Route_SoulMax = 0>>
<<declare $HiddenEndingTrigger = false>>
<<jump ITC_Act1_Scene11_Awake>>
===

title: ITC_Act1_Scene11_Awake
---
<<itc_bg hotel_room>>
<<itc_pc_avatar barks_default>>
<<itc_npc_main_hide>>
<<itc_npc_avatar_hide>>
Narrator: |fade|Barks 睁开眼睛，<waitfor=0.18>发现自己身处一个小而简陋的接待室。
Narrator: |fade|她试图回忆昨晚发生的事，<waitfor=0.18>但脑海<fade>一片空白</fade>。
Barks: |typewriter|<speed=1.08>我是谁？<waitfor=0.18>我在哪？<waitfor=0.24>我为什么会在这里？
Narrator: |fade|<waitfor=0.58>一个声音在耳边响起。
Narrator: |fade|欢迎来到<incr>地狱</incr>，<waitfor=0.12>新来的。
Narrator: |fade|Barks 从床上爬起来，<waitfor=0.12>环顾四周，<waitfor=0.2>房间陈旧而陌生。
Barks: |typewriter|<speed=0.95>冷静点，<waitfor=0.12>伙计。你在陌生的地方，<waitfor=0.18>记忆丢失，<waitfor=0.24>先活下来再说。
Narrator: |fade|<waitfor=0.12>突然，一阵<shake a=0.6>响亮的敲门声</shake>在房间里回荡。
<<jump ITC_Act1_Scene12_Doorman>>
===

title: ITC_Act1_Scene12_Doorman
---
<<itc_bg mirror_room>>
<<itc_npc_main skeletonbellboy_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar skeletonbellboy_default>>
Narrator: |fade|Barks 打开门，<waitfor=0.12>看到一个穿着门童服装的<wiggle>骷髅</wiggle>。
SkeletonBellboy: |typewriter|瞧你那模样，<waitfor=0.18>倒像是看到<wave s=0.8>活人</wave>了似的。
Barks: |typewriter|你......<waitfor=0.42>我......<waitfor=0.55>我在哪里？
SkeletonBellboy: |fade|这是地狱接待处。<waitfor=0.18>你已经死了，<waitfor=0.12>而且成了<incr>无魂者</incr>。
Narrator: |fade|Barks 低头检查自己的身体，<waitfor=0.12>心跳和呼吸都消失了。
Barks: |typewriter|不仅死了，<waitfor=0.12>还成了个<wiggle>行走的时尚灾难</wiggle>。
Narrator: |fade|她挣扎许久，<waitfor=0.24>最终只记得自己的名字，<waitfor=0.62><incr>巴克斯 卡莱特</incr>。
Narrator: |fade|<waitfor=0.85>
<<jump ITC_Act1_Scene13_LetterKey>>
===

title: ITC_Act1_Scene13_LetterKey
---
<<itc_bg mirror_room>>
<<itc_npc_main skeletonbellboy_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar skeletonbellboy_default>>
SkeletonBellboy: |fade|小姐，<waitfor=0.12>新来的无魂者都这样，<waitfor=0.18>习惯就好。<waitfor=0.12>这是给你的信和钥匙。
Narrator: |fade|钥匙上刻着<incr>圣纽约市</incr>，<waitfor=0.12>金属边缘泛着不自然的冷光。
SkeletonBellboy: |fade|这把钥匙可以带你<wave s=0.7>回到人间</wave>，<waitfor=0.18>门就在旅馆外。
Narrator: |fade|Barks 打开信件，<waitfor=0.12>纸张发出干涩的摩擦声。
Narrator: |fade|欢迎来到地狱。<waitfor=0.24>等你适应后，<waitfor=0.18>来 Infernal Transfer Company 找我。
Narrator: |fade|附上一份诚聘请柬。<waitfor=0.18>毕竟<incr>灵魂</incr>是这里唯一的硬通货。
Barks: |typewriter|看来地狱之旅才<waitfor=0.12>刚刚开始。
<<jump ITC_Act1_Scene14_FlameGate>>
===

title: ITC_Act1_Scene14_FlameGate
---
<<itc_bg flame_gate>>
<<itc_npc_main_hide>>
<<itc_npc_avatar_hide>>
Narrator: |fade|Barks 来到旅馆外，<waitfor=0.18>看见那扇被火焰包围的门。
Narrator: |fade|她将钥匙插入锁孔，<waitfor=0.12><shake a=0.45>火焰骤然暴涨</shake>。
Narrator: |fade|门开了，<waitfor=0.18>一道刺眼光芒涌出，<waitfor=0.24>她踏入其中。
<<jump ITC_Act1_Scene15_City>>
===

title: ITC_Act1_Scene15_City
---
<<itc_bg city_center>>
<<itc_npc_main_hide>>
<<itc_npc_avatar_hide>>
Narrator: |fade|Barks 在圣纽约市中心醒来，<waitfor=0.18>城市繁华而荒诞。
Barks: |typewriter|那边居然有人在向一棵树兜售保险，<waitfor=0.18>天呐。
Barks: |typewriter|也许我们都<wiggle s=0.8>疯了</wiggle>。<waitfor=0.2>谁会清醒地来应聘地狱公司呢？
Narrator: |fade|她决定按请柬地址，<waitfor=0.12>前往 Infernal Transfer Company。
<<jump ITC_Act1_Scene16_Building>>
===

title: ITC_Act1_Scene16_Building
---
<<itc_bg itc_building>>
<<itc_npc_main_hide>>
<<itc_npc_avatar_hide>>
Narrator: |fade|Barks 来到 ITC 大楼前，<waitfor=0.12>门框写着 Infernal Transfer Company。
Narrator: |fade|下面还有一行小字，<waitfor=0.12><slideh s=0.6>Where souls meet beans</slideh>。
Barks: |typewriter|既然来了，<waitfor=0.12>就入乡随俗吧。
<<jump ITC_Act1_Scene17_GuardHenet>>
===

title: ITC_Act1_Scene17_GuardHenet
---
<<itc_bg itc_guard>>
<<itc_npc_main oldguard_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar oldguard_default>>
Narrator: |fade|Barks 在门卫窗口前抬头，<waitfor=0.12>看见楼上窗边的 Henet。
Narrator: |fade|她的目光像能洞穿灵魂，<waitfor=0.18>美艳而危险。
Barks: |typewriter|她看起来像噩梦里走出来的<incr>恶魔</incr>。
OldGuard: |fade|Barks 小姐，<waitfor=0.12>Henet 女士要求你立刻去她办公室。
Barks: |typewriter|我才刚到，<waitfor=0.18>连公司做什么都不清楚。
OldGuard: |fade|<speed=0.92>在 ITC，<waitfor=0.12>我们遵从上级指令。<waitfor=0.18>快去吧。
<<jump ITC_Act2_Scene21_Lobby>>
===

title: ITC_Act2_Scene21_Lobby
---
<<itc_bg itc_lobby>>
<<itc_npc_main receptionist_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar receptionist_default>>
<<set $Sys_CurrentPhase = "Day1_PreWork">>
Narrator: |fade|DAY {$DAY}，<waitfor=0.12>Barks 推开 ITC 大门，走进大厅。
Receptionist: |typewriter|<speed=1.05>欢迎来到 Infernal Transfer Company。<waitfor=0.12>请问你有预约吗？
Barks: |typewriter|门口那位骷髅先生<waitfor=0.12>让我去 Henet 女士办公室。
Receptionist: |typewriter|<speed=1.03>电梯在右手边。<waitfor=0.12>Henet 女士办公室在 6 层 66 号房。
Barks: |typewriter|6 层 66 号，<waitfor=0.18>真是毫不掩饰。
<<jump ITC_Act2_Scene22_Elevator>>
===

title: ITC_Act2_Scene22_Elevator
---
<<itc_bg itc_elevator>>
<<itc_npc_main oldtom_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar oldtom_default>>
Narrator: |fade|Barks 乘电梯到 6 层，<waitfor=0.12>遇见了 OLD TOM。
OldTom: |fade|你好，<waitfor=0.12>年轻人。<waitfor=0.18>你是来见 Henet 女士的？
Barks: |typewriter|是的，<waitfor=0.12>我在找她办公室。
OldTom: |fade|她今天心情不太好，<waitfor=0.12>昨天灵魂配额没达标。
Barks: |typewriter|谢谢提醒，<waitfor=0.12>我会尽量不成为她今天第一个<wiggle s=0.75>牺牲品</wiggle>。
OldTom: |fade|我是 Old Tom。<waitfor=0.12>需要帮助时，<waitfor=0.12>随时来找我。
<<jump ITC_Act2_Scene23_OfficeContract>>
===

title: ITC_Act2_Scene23_OfficeContract
---
<<itc_bg henet_office>>
<<itc_npc_main henet_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar henet_default>>
Narrator: |fade|Henet 坐在书桌后面，<waitfor=0.12>审视着 Barks。
Henet: |fade|我是这家公司的老板 Henet。<waitfor=0.18>我们做<incr>灵魂契约</incr>和豆类罐头销售。<waitfor=0.24>你有什么特长？
Barks: |typewriter|我......<waitfor=0.32>我擅长签合同和......<waitfor=0.4>数豆子？
Henet: |fade|太棒了。<waitfor=0.12>欢迎加入 ITC，<incr>试工期 13 天</incr>。
Narrator: |fade|Henet 递来合同，<waitfor=0.12>Barks 指尖有些发冷。
Narrator: |fade|本人自愿成为 ITC 试工期文员，<waitfor=0.12>13 天内尽职尽责。<waitfor=0.24>违约将遭受<incr>永恒惩罚</incr>。
Barks: |typewriter|这合同是不是有点......<waitfor=0.45>
Henet: |fade|怎么，<waitfor=0.12>你有什么补充吗？
Narrator: |fade|Barks 颤抖着签下名字，<waitfor=0.12>墨迹晕开。
Henet: |fade|你的岗位在 13 号窗口。<waitfor=0.18>每天正确完整服务 8 位客户。
Henet: |fade|如果你没通过试工期，<waitfor=0.18>你会在圣纽约过得<incr>更惨</incr>。
<<jump ITC_Act2_Scene24_Training>>
===

title: ITC_Act2_Scene24_Training
---
<<itc_bg window13>>
<<itc_npc_main oldclerk13_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar oldclerk13_default>>
Narrator: |fade|Barks 来到 13 号窗口，<waitfor=0.12>一位老员工正在等她。
OldClerk13: |fade|欢迎新人。<waitfor=0.18>我终于快退休了，<waitfor=0.18>先把工作流程交给你。
OldClerk13: |typewriter|<speed=1.02>先问候，<waitfor=0.12>再聆听客户陈述，<waitfor=0.12>然后检查文件。
OldClerk13: |typewriter|<speed=1.02>核对封蜡、文书真伪、内容一致性、预约日期和身份，<waitfor=0.18>一步都不能错。
OldClerk13: |typewriter|<speed=1.02>然后完成打字机录入、印章判定、灵魂收成，<waitfor=0.18>流程才算闭环。
OldClerk13: |fade|在 ITC，<waitfor=0.12>失误会直接影响客户满意度和你的<incr>去留</incr>。
Narrator: |fade|老员工正准备握手，<waitfor=0.12>骨架<shake a=0.55>突然散落一地</shake>。
Barks: |typewriter|你......<waitfor=0.35>你还好吗？
Barks: |typewriter|这就是我的未来吗？<waitfor=0.28>
<<jump ITC_Act2_Scene25_WorkReady>>
===

title: ITC_Act2_Scene25_WorkReady
---
<<itc_bg window13>>
<<itc_npc_main oldtom_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar oldtom_default>>
OldTom: |fade|早上好，<waitfor=0.12>13 号窗口的试用期文员，Barks 小姐。
Receptionist: |typewriter|<speed=1.06>这是早班咖啡。<waitfor=0.18>公司规定每日摄入至少 250 毫升。
Barks: |typewriter|这比我喝过的任何东西都苦。<waitfor=0.18>
Veer: |fade|新员工，<waitfor=0.12>让我看看你的脑子里装了些什么。
Barks: |typewriter|你是从哪里冒出来的？<waitfor=0.12>
Veer: |fade|物理是种幻觉。<waitfor=0.12>就像<wave s=0.7>理智</wave>一样。
OldTom: |fade|够了，<waitfor=0.12>Veer。<waitfor=0.12>别吓坏新员工。
Narrator: |fade|Barks 独自留在 13 号窗口，<waitfor=0.18>准备迎接第一位客户。
<<set $Sys_CurrentPhase = "Contracting">>
<<jump ITC_Act3_Entry>>
===

title: ITC_Act3_Entry
---
<<itc_bg window13>>
Narrator: |typewriter|签约主线开始。<waitfor=0.18>当前 DAY 为 {$DAY}。
<<if $DAY == 1>>
    <<jump ITC_Day1_ClientSequence>>
<<else>>
    <<if $DAY == 2>>
        <<jump ITC_Day2_ClientSequence>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump ITC_Day3Plus_ClientSequence>>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: ITC_Day1_ClientSequence
---
<<itc_bg window13>>
<<itc_npc_main_hide>>
<<itc_npc_avatar_hide>>
Narrator: |typewriter|DAY 1 客户序列开始。<waitfor=0.18>
<<jump ITC_Client1_Emmett_Intro>>
===

title: ITC_Client1_Emmett_Intro
---
<<itc_bg window13>>
<<itc_npc_main emmett_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar emmett_default>>
<<set $Route_CurrentClient = 1>>
<<set $Sign_mistake = 0>>
<<set $satisfaction = 3>>
Narrator: |fade|第一位客户来到窗口，<waitfor=0.12>满身酒气。
Emmett: |typewriter|嘿，<waitfor=0.12>小妞。<waitfor=0.12>听说你们能让人一直喝酒？<waitfor=0.12>我要这个。
Barks: |typewriter|先生，<waitfor=0.12>您是想千杯不醉吗？
Emmett: |typewriter|不，<waitfor=0.12>我要永远有喝不完的酒。
Barks: |typewriter|这可能不太健康......<waitfor=0.32>
Emmett: |typewriter|健康早跟我说再见了。<waitfor=0.18>给我签个<incr>最烈</incr>的契约。
Narrator: |typewriter|文件信息：<waitfor=0.12>姓名埃米特 多伊尔，<waitfor=0.12>职业无业，<waitfor=0.12>申请永远喝不完的酒，<waitfor=0.12>灵魂份额五成。
<<jump ITC_Client1_FileCheck>>
===

title: ITC_Client1_FileCheck
---
<<itc_bg window13>>
<<itc_npc_main emmett_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar emmett_default>>
Narrator: |typewriter|是否退回文件。<waitfor=0.18>
<<itc_doc_review 1>>
<<if $Route_DocReviewResult == "passed">>
    Narrator: |typewriter|<wave s=0.7>判定正确</wave>，<waitfor=0.12>进入后续流程。
<<elseif $Route_DocReviewResult == "rejected_correct">>
    Narrator: |typewriter|<wave s=0.7>判定正确</wave>，<waitfor=0.12>文件退回处理完成。
<<else>>
    Narrator: |typewriter|<shake a=0.45>判定错误</shake>。<waitfor=0.12>该文件本应继续流程。
<<endif>>
<<jump ITC_Client1_TypewriterInput>>
===

title: ITC_Client1_TypewriterInput
---
<<itc_bg window13>>
<<itc_npc_main emmett_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar emmett_default>>
Narrator: |typewriter|打字机环节，<waitfor=0.12>4 个方向键 QTE。
-> 完美输入，无失误
    <<set $Route_QTEErrorCount = 0>>
    <<jump C2_D155>>
-> 出现一次失误
    <<set $Route_QTEErrorCount = 1>>
    <<jump C2_D155>>
-> 出现两次失误
    <<set $Route_QTEErrorCount = 2>>
    <<jump C2_D155>>
-> 出现三次及以上失误
    <<set $Route_QTEErrorCount = 3>>
    <<jump C2_D155>>
===

