title: ITC_Client1_PostContract
---
<<itc_bg henet_office>>
<<itc_npc_main henet_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar henet_default>>
<<if $Sign_mistake == 0>>
    <<set $First_contract_sign_success = 1>>
<<endif>>
<<jump C3_D252>>
===

title: ITC_Client2_Thomas_Intro
---
<<itc_bg window13>>
<<itc_npc_main thomas_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar thomas_default>>
<<set $Route_CurrentClient = 2>>
<<set $Sign_mistake = 0>>
<<set $satisfaction = 3>>
Narrator: |fade|第二位客户步伐缓慢地来到窗口，<waitfor=0.12>面色灰白，<waitfor=0.12>不停咳嗽。
Thomas: |typewriter|<speed=0.94>我是托马斯 芬奇，<waitfor=0.12>从圣卡特迩医院来。<waitfor=0.18>开始签约吧，小姐。
Narrator: |typewriter|文件信息：<waitfor=0.12>姓名托马斯 芬奇，<waitfor=0.12>职业煤矿工人，<waitfor=0.12>申请治愈肺病，<waitfor=0.12>灵魂份额五成到六成。
Narrator: |typewriter|日期仅写 4 月 1 日，<waitfor=0.12>缺少年份，<waitfor=0.12>但这不构成退回理由。
Thomas: |typewriter|<speed=0.93>我在矿场干了二十年，<waitfor=0.12>现在连站着都困难。<waitfor=0.18>我妻子和三个孩子都指望我。
Barks: |typewriter|你将获得肺部重生，<waitfor=0.12>但要付出灵魂份额，<waitfor=0.12>可能失去部分情感体验。<waitfor=0.18>你确定吗？
Thomas: |typewriter|当你每天都在和死亡赛跑时，<waitfor=0.12>所谓体验已经<incr>不重要了</incr>。
<<jump ITC_Client2_FileCheck>>
===

title: ITC_Client2_FileCheck
---
<<itc_bg window13>>
<<itc_npc_main thomas_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar thomas_default>>
Narrator: |typewriter|是否退回文件。<waitfor=0.18>
<<itc_doc_review 2>>
<<if $Route_DocReviewResult == "passed">>
    Narrator: |typewriter|<wave s=0.7>判定正确</wave>，<waitfor=0.12>进入后续流程。
<<elseif $Route_DocReviewResult == "rejected_correct">>
    Narrator: |typewriter|<wave s=0.7>判定正确</wave>，<waitfor=0.12>文件退回处理完成。
<<else>>
    Narrator: |typewriter|<shake a=0.45>判定错误</shake>。<waitfor=0.12>该文件应继续流程。
<<endif>>
<<jump ITC_Client2_TypewriterInput>>
===

title: ITC_Client2_TypewriterInput
---
<<itc_bg window13>>
<<itc_npc_main thomas_default>>
<<itc_npc_avatar thomas_default>>
Narrator: |typewriter|打字机环节，<waitfor=0.12>4 个方向键 QTE。
-> 完美输入，无失误
    <<set $Route_QTEErrorCount = 0>>
    <<jump C2_D155>>
-> 出现一次失误
    <<set $Route_QTEErrorCount = 1>>
    <<jump C2_D155>>
-> 出现两次失误
    <<set $Route_QTEErrorCount = 2>>
    <<jump C2_D155>>
-> 出现三次及以上失误
    <<set $Route_QTEErrorCount = 3>>
    <<jump C2_D155>>
===

